The wake paragraph now says what a wake sees after the owner's answer 3A: the Main turn's own view
(the integrator's spec with Main as its room, since a wake has no chat of its own), its "This room (Main)"
byte for byte as the Main turn renders it, plus the words of people in the other live rooms, my own
replies there staying one memory_read by address. The old text described a wake without a room that saw
Main as one line.
